Author: Kenneth Jiang <kenneth.jiang@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Sep 29 15:44:12 2026 -0700

    Spike: measure how long project saves block the main thread

    Adds a --save-cost mode to the workspace adapter harness. It loads
    generated fixtures (tiny, typical, medium, large, huge, many), times
    the backup write, the checkpoint write and the full save with the
    export progress stages, and measures how long OrcaSlicer's backup
    thread takes to rewrite an object's mesh file after an edit.

    tests/workspace/save_cost/run.sh generates the fixtures, runs the
    probe and prints a summary table. Spike code; not for merging.

    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M3QNE1WGTNQ6M9FM9CB4V021

